oney Management</a></li><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c4155956442="" class="menu-item ng-star-inserted"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c4155956442="" role="menuitem" class="grv-shr-lib-text--small" aria-disabled="false" dataislast="false" href="/learn-grow/more-than-money">More Than Money</a></li><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c4155956442="" class="menu-item ng-star-inserted"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c4155956442="" role="menuitem" class="grv-shr-lib-text--small" aria-disabled="false" dataislast="false" href="/learn-grow/privacy-security">Privacy &amp; Security</a></li><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c4155956442="" class="menu-item ng-star-inserted"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c4155956442="" role="menuitem" class="grv-shr-lib-text--small" aria-disabled="false" dataislast="true" href="/learn-grow/business-resources">Business Resources</a></li><!----><!----></ul></div></div><!----></div></div></div></div></shared-menu><!----></shared-cms-base-shared-component><!----><!----><!----><shared-cms-base-shared-component class="legacy-component ng-star-inserted"><shared-article-detail _nghost-web-shell-c429481285="" class="ng-star-inserted"><section _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="container hst-container-item article-detail ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="fluid-width article-content"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-grid"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-row"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-8 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-10 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-offset-1"><h1 _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="headline"> Capital One Shopping: A free tool to find deals online </h1><!----></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-8 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-12 article-hero-section"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="fluid-width article-hero ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" data-lcp-priority="true" sharedlazyload="" style="object-position: center;" alt="" src="https://ecm.capitalone.com/WCM/learn-grow/card/lgc1270_hero_capital-one-shopping_v1/rdesktop.jpg" decoding="sync" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-8 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-10 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-offset-1 article-content-section"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-row article-info-bar"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="article-info grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-5 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-8"><!----><p _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-text--small info-text"><span _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="date-published">March 12, 2026</span><span _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="meta-pipe ng-star-inserted">|</span><!----></span><!----><span _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="ng-star-inserted">3 min read</span><!----></p></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="social-parent grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-3 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-4"><shared-social-toolbar _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c115995925=""><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" class="social-media-bar"><ul _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925=""><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" class="share-button twitter"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" aria-label="Share on X" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-media-icons twitter" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Flearn-grow%2Fmoney-management%2Fcapital-one-shopping%2F"></a></li><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" class="share-button linkedin"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" aria-label="Share on LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-media-icons linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Flearn-grow%2Fmoney-management%2Fcapital-one-shopping%2F&amp;title=Capital%20One%20Shopping%3A%20A%20free%20tool%20to%20find%20deals%20online"></a></li><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" class="share-button facebook"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" aria-label="Share on Facebook" class="social-media-icons facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Flearn-grow%2Fmoney-management%2Fcapital-one-shopping%2F"></a></li><li _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" class="share-button email"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c115995925="" aria-label="Share with Email" class="social-media-icons email" href="mailto:?subject=Capital%20One%20Shopping%3A%20A%20free%20tool%20to%20find%20deals%20online&amp;body=%0Ahttp%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Flearn-grow%2Fmoney-management%2Fcapital-one-shopping%2F%3Fexternal_id%3DCARD_CMEM"></a></li></ul></div></shared-social-toolbar></div></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-row"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 text-center"><span _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" style="position: relative;"></span></div></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-row"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 article-body-content"><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Saving money while shopping online is always better when it’s easy. And Capital One Shopping makes finding great deals online a breeze. It instantly finds and tests coupon codes, searches retailers for better prices and notifies you when prices drop. It even lets you earn rewards to redeem for gift cards.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Plus, Capital One Shopping is free.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>What you’ll learn:</strong></p>

<ul>
 <li>
 <p>Capital One Shopping makes it easier to save money while shopping online.</p>
 </li>
 <li>
 <p>Capital One Shopping works with most major internet browsers, and it’s free.</p>
 </li>
 <li>
 <p>You can also use the Capital One Shopping app on most phones.</p>
 </li>
 <li>
 <p>Capital One Shopping automatically finds and tests coupon and promo codes, gives you instant price comparisons, tells you if prices drop on items you’ve viewed and lets you earn rewards.</p>
 </li>
</ul></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><shared-nested-image-and-text-panel _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" _nghost-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="ng-star-inserted"><section _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="cta-banner-section"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="grv-shr-lib-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="grv-shr-lib-grid"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="grv-shr-lib-row grv-shr-lib-row--fill cta-banner-container"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--ml-4 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-6 grv-shr-lib-col--xl-7 cta-banner-image-panel"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="cta-banner-background-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" sharedlazyload="" style="object-position: center center;" alt="Animation of a credit card approval" src="https://ecm.capitalone.com/WCM/learn-grow/card/preapproval_cardcheck_r02.gif" decoding="auto" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low"></div><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--ml-4 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-6 grv-shr-lib-col--xl-5 cta-banner-content-panel"><!----><h4 _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="headline ng-star-inserted">Check for guaranteed card offers</h4><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="subheadline ng-star-inserted">See if you'll be approved with 100% certainty and no risk to your credit score.</div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="ng-star-inserted"><a _ngcontent-web-shell-c1058880371="" class="grv-shr-lib-button--progressive" href="https://www.capitalone.com/credit-cards/preapprove/?external_id=USCARD_PAV2001_BLG_LGRO_PAV2_WEB_GIF_CTA_D99_ZZZ" target="_self" data-initial-value="Check eligibility" data-event-info="CTA103_PA_BAU">Check eligibility</a></div><!----></div></div></div></div></section><!----><!----></shared-nested-image-and-text-panel><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><h2 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-header ng-star-inserted"> What is Capital One Shopping? </h2><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p><a href="https://capitaloneshopping.com/lp/mobilewebrd?utm_source=c1lp&amp;creative_id=learn_grow_blg_main1">Capital One Shopping</a> is a free browser extension and mobile app that automatically searches for online coupons, better prices and rewards at over 100,000 online retailers. That makes it easier to save money when you shop online.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-small-header ng-star-inserted"> Is there a fee for Capital One Shopping? </h3><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>There are no fees for using Capital One Shopping. It’s free for everyone, even people who aren’t already Capital One customers.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><h2 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-header ng-star-inserted"> How does Capital One Shopping work? </h2><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Using the Capital One Shopping extension is simple. It works with all major browsers, including Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Microsoft Edge and Safari. You can also use the Capital One Shopping app on <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/capital-one-shopping-save-now/id1089294040" target="_blank">iOS</a> and <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.wikibuy.prod.main" target="_blank">Android</a> devices.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Once you install the browser extension or app, you can shop normally. Capital One Shopping works quietly in the background to help you save money. Here’s how.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-small-header ng-star-inserted"> Coupon codes </h3><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>When it’s time to check out, Capital One Shopping searches for available coupons and promo codes, automatically applying valid ones to your purchase. That can save you money and a lot of time looking for codes that may not work.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-small-header ng-star-inserted"> Price comparisons </h3><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Capital One Shopping automatically compares prices online when you shop at certain retailers. It even checks shipping costs and membership pricing.</p>

<p>When it finds a better price, Capital One Shopping shows you the cost difference and provides a link to the retailer with the better deal.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-small-header ng-star-inserted"> Price-drop notifications </h3><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Capital One Shopping keeps track of items you’ve viewed and may send you a notification when a price drops.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-small-header ng-star-inserted"> Rewards </h3><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Even if discounts or better prices aren’t available, you could still earn rewards by making eligible purchases through Capital One Shopping partner sites. These rewards are independent of the rewards you might earn with a <a href="https://www.capitalone.com/learn-grow/money-management/what-rewards-credit-card-is-right-for-you/">Capital One rewards credit card</a>.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><h2 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-header ng-star-inserted"> How to redeem Capital One Shopping Rewards </h2><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>You can <a href="https://capitaloneshopping.com/my-rewards/redeem">redeem your Capital One Shopping Rewards</a> for digital gift cards from dozens of retailers. Once you’ve redeemed your rewards, it can take up to three business days for gift cards to appear in your account.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><h3 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-small-header ng-star-inserted"> Do Capital One Shopping Rewards expire? </h3><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Capital One Shopping Rewards won’t expire as long as your account is active and in good standing.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><shared-article-body _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><h2 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="article-body-header ng-star-inserted"> Key takeaways: Capital One Shopping </h2><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2674949388="" class="grv-shr-lib-font articleBodyContent ng-star-inserted"><p>Saving money with <a href="https://capitaloneshopping.com/lp/mobilewebrd?utm_source=c1lp&amp;creative_id=learn_grow_blg_main1">Capital One Shopping</a> is simple. Once you’re signed up, it starts working immediately, searching for coupons and better prices when you shop online. There’s nothing you need to do except shop, sit back and enjoy the savings.</p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></shared-article-body><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-row cemp-survey-container"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--xs-4 grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-8 grv-shr-lib-col--ml-6 grv-shr-lib-col--lg-8"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" id="cemp-site-learnandgrow-article-helpfulness"></div></div></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div><!----><shared-article-card-set _ngcontent-web-shell-c429481285="" _nghost-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="container"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-grid"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-row"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-col"><h4 _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-text--normal-semibold container__headline">Related Content</h4></div></div><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-row"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="grv-shr-lib-col--lg-4 grv-shr-lib-col--md-third grv-shr-lib-col--sm-4 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" class="container__card"><shared-article-card _ngcontent-web-shell-c2186608966="" _nghost-web-shell-c2746461869=""><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2746461869="" class="grv-shr-lib-card card"><bre-cms-edit-button _ngcontent-web-shell-c2746461869="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div style="position: relative;"><span></span></div></bre-cms-edit-button><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2746461869="" class="card__image-container ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-web-shell-c2746461869="" sharedlazyload="" class="card__image" alt="A woman uses Capital One Shopping on her laptop to find the best deal while shopping online." src="https://ecm.capitalone.com/WCM/learn-grow/card/lgc190_how-capital-one-makes-shopping-easier/rmobile.jpg" decoding="auto" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low"></div><!----><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2746461869="" class="grv-shr-lib-card__content"><div _ngcontent-web-shell-c2746461869=